# Single Pyproject Dependency Rule

When adding or updating Python dependencies, always use only one file:

- `source/pyproject.toml`

Mandatory constraints:

- Do not create any other `pyproject.toml` in subfolders.
- Do not split dependencies by folder.
- Treat `source/pyproject.toml` as the latest and only dependency source of truth.

If locking is needed, update the single lock file from `source` root:

- `source/uv.lock`
